{"seq":2,"slug":"hot-transaction-patterns","title":"热点更新与事务设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/mysql-performance-operations/transactions-locking/hot-transaction-patterns","wordCount":2499,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"热点更新与事务设计模式\">热点更新与事务设计模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个计数器的更新语句只有一行，逻辑上简单到不能再简单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE counters SET value = value + 1 WHERE id = &#39;order_created&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counters </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'order_created'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在单线程下它每秒能跑上万次。在一万个并发请求下，它的吞吐会掉到几十次每秒——而且随着并发数上升还会继续下降。这不是因为锁本身慢，而是因为<strong>所有等待者持有事务所需要的一切资源</strong>：undo 空间、连接、以及最关键的——它们在等锁期间什么都不做，但每个都消耗一个数据库连接和一份内存。</p>\n<p>这个现象的准确描述是：<strong>串行化的关键资源 + 排队 = 吞吐崩塌</strong>。一万个事务争一行，最终吞吐等于单行更新的极限吞吐（受 fsync 与 latch 限制），而所有排队的请求都在消耗资源。更糟的是，等待时间越长，死锁与超时的概率越高，而超时重试会进一步加剧竞争。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[高并发写入同一行] --&gt; B{是否可拆分?}&#10;  B --&gt;|计数类, 可近似| C[行间拆分: N 个子行&lt;br/&gt;随机/取模选择]&#10;  B --&gt;|计数类, 需精确| D[原子递增 + 批量读取汇总]&#10;  B --&gt;|状态机流转| E[条件更新: WHERE status=&#39;OLD&#39;&lt;br/&gt;用 affected_rows 判成功]&#10;  B --&gt;|余额/库存| F[单语句原子扣减&lt;br/&gt;WHERE balance &gt;= amount]&#10;  C --&gt; G[写入分散, 读取需 SUM]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; H[无读-改-写窗口]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; I[还需: 批量提交降低 fsync&lt;br/&gt;缩短事务持锁时间]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[监控: row_lock_waits&lt;br/&gt;deadlock 计数]\">graph TD\n  A[高并发写入同一行] --&gt; B{是否可拆分?}\n  B --&gt;|计数类, 可近似| C[行间拆分: N 个子行&lt;br/&gt;随机/取模选择]\n  B --&gt;|计数类, 需精确| D[原子递增 + 批量读取汇总]\n  B --&gt;|状态机流转| E[条件更新: WHERE status='OLD'&lt;br/&gt;用 affected_rows 判成功]\n  B --&gt;|余额/库存| F[单语句原子扣减&lt;br/&gt;WHERE balance &gt;= amount]\n  C --&gt; G[写入分散, 读取需 SUM]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; H[无读-改-写窗口]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; I[还需: 批量提交降低 fsync&lt;br/&gt;缩短事务持锁时间]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[监控: row_lock_waits&lt;br/&gt;deadlock 计数]</pre><h2 id=\"行间拆分-把热点打散\">行间拆分：把热点打散</h2><p>对于计数这类<strong>允许近似或者可以在读取时汇总</strong>的场景，最有效的做法是把一行拆成 N 行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE counters (&#10;  key_name VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,&#10;  shard_id TINYINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,&#10;  value BIGINT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (key_name, shard_id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 写入: 随机选择一个分片(应用侧生成 shard_id)&#10;INSERT INTO counters (key_name, shard_id, value) VALUES (&#39;order_created&#39;, ?, 1)&#10;ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE value = value + 1;&#10;&#10;-- 读取: 汇总所有分片&#10;SELECT SUM(value) FROM counters WHERE key_name = &#39;order_created&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> counters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  key_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shard_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UNSIGNED </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (key_name, shard_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 写入: 随机选择一个分片(应用侧生成 shard_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counters (key_name, shard_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_created'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ?, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DUPLICATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 读取: 汇总所有分片</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counters </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'order_created'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>拆分的收益是<strong>线性的</strong>：16 个分片能把并发写入分散到 16 行，锁冲突概率降到约 1/16。代价是读取需要 <code>SUM</code>，且这个读取本身会扫描 16 行（可接受，因为 16 行的索引扫描是微秒级）。分片数不需要很大——实践中 8–32 已经能解决绝大多数热点；继续增加到几百个只会让读取变慢而收益递减。</p>\n<p>拆分方案的选择取决于&quot;读取是否需要精确&quot;和&quot;写入是否可近似&quot;，两种形状的取舍可以用下表对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拆分方案</th>\n<th>写入方式</th>\n<th>读取方式</th>\n<th>读取精度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单行原子递增</td>\n<td><code>value = value + 1</code></td>\n<td>直接读</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>写入 QPS &lt; 1000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>N 行随机分片</td>\n<td><code>ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE</code> 随机 <code>shard_id</code></td>\n<td><code>SUM(value)</code></td>\n<td>精确（读取时汇总）</td>\n<td>写入 QPS 1e3–1e5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存缓冲 + 定期合并</td>\n<td>应用内存累加，定时批量落库</td>\n<td>读时叠加内存值</td>\n<td>最终一致（窗口内近似）</td>\n<td>可接受秒级延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>队列 + 异步落库</td>\n<td>投递到 MQ，消费者批量写</td>\n<td>读物化结果</td>\n<td>异步</td>\n<td>非实时展示类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一行的分界线值得说明：单行原子递增在写入 QPS 低于 1000 时是简单且正确的选择，只有在实测出现锁等待增长时才需要引入拆分。过早拆分带来的是读取路径复杂化与&quot;分片数该设多少&quot;的永久维护负担。</p>\n<p>关于分片的选择方式有一个细节值得注意。如果用 <code>RAND()</code> 在 SQL 里随机，每次写入都要生成随机数（小开销）但分布均匀。如果用应用侧生成的会话相关值（比如用户 ID 取模），同一用户的写入会集中到同一分片——这在&quot;同一用户高频操作&quot;的场景下会把热点原样保留。所以<strong>分片键的选择目标是让同一时刻的热点请求落到不同分片</strong>，用随机或按请求 ID 取模比按用户取模更合适。</p>\n<p>需要注意 <code>ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE</code> 本身在并发插入同一个键时存在锁升级问题（见 <a href=\"../query-tuning/lock-wait-deadlock\">行锁、间隙锁与死锁排查</a>），但在这里由于分片已经分散，同一分片上的并发冲突概率低，实际影响可以接受。更保险的写法是先 <code>INSERT IGNORE</code> 再 <code>UPDATE</code>，或者应用侧维护&quot;该分片是否已存在&quot;的状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原子递增与单语句条件更新\">原子递增与单语句条件更新</h2><p><strong>读写分离的窗口是并发 bug 的温床。</strong> 下面这个模式在代码评审中出现频率极高：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 反模式: 先读后写, 两步之间可以插入其他事务&#10;BEGIN;&#10;SELECT balance FROM accounts WHERE id = 1;      -- 读到 100&#10;-- 应用: if (balance &gt;= 50) { ... }&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance - 50 WHERE id = 1;&#10;COMMIT;&#10;&#10;-- 正模式: 条件与修改在一条语句里, 由 InnoDB 的锁保证原子&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance - 50&#10;WHERE id = 1 AND balance &gt;= 50;&#10;-- 通过 affected_rows == 1 判断成功, 0 判断余额不足\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 反模式: 先读后写, 两步之间可以插入其他事务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 读到 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 应用: if (balance >= 50) { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 正模式: 条件与修改在一条语句里, 由 InnoDB 的锁保证原子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 通过 affected_rows == 1 判断成功, 0 判断余额不足</span></span></code></pre></div><p>正模式的正确性来自 <a href=\"isolation-mvcc\">隔离级别、MVCC 与 ReadView</a> 里讲的当前读语义：<code>UPDATE</code> 是当前读，它在读取最新版本后就加 X 锁，条件判断与修改在同一个持锁过程中完成。</p>\n<p>状态机流转用同样的手法，只是判断条件不是数值而是状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 订单从 PENDING 流转到 PAID, 防止重复支付&#10;UPDATE orders SET status = &#39;PAID&#39;, paid_at = NOW(6)&#10;WHERE id = 12345 AND status = &#39;PENDING&#39;;&#10;-- affected_rows == 1 表示本次流转成功; == 0 表示已被其他请求处理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 订单从 PENDING 流转到 PAID, 防止重复支付</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, paid_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12345</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- affected_rows == 1 表示本次流转成功; == 0 表示已被其他请求处理</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个写法的额外收益是它天然幂等：重复调用第二次会因为 <code>status</code> 已经是 <code>PAID</code> 而返回 0 行。这比&quot;先 <code>SELECT</code> 判断再 <code>UPDATE</code>&quot;的写法既快又安全，因为前者需要在应用侧加分布式锁才能保证正确。</p>\n<p>有一个细节需要注意：MySQL 默认的 <code>affected_rows</code> 语义是&quot;<strong>实际改变的行数</strong>&quot;，而 <code>UPDATE</code> 把某行设为它已有的值时不算改变。这正好是我们想要的（状态已经是 <code>PAID</code> 就不算成功）。但如果需要&quot;匹配行数&quot;而非&quot;改变行数&quot;，需要在连接参数中开启 <code>CLIENT_FOUND_ROWS</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批量提交-降低-fsync-次数而非降低事务数\">批量提交：降低 fsync 次数而非降低事务数</h2><p>在 <a href=\"../innodb-internals/redo-undo-binlog\">redo/undo/binlog 与两阶段提交</a> 里已经量化过：一次提交至少两次 fsync，单连接的理论上限在 5000–16000 QPS 之间。突破这个上限的途径是<strong>让多个事务共享一次 fsync</strong>，也就是组提交（group commit）。</p>\n<p>组提交由 InnoDB 自动完成，触发条件是&quot;同时有多个事务在等待提交&quot;。因此应用层能做的优化是<strong>制造并发交错的提交</strong>，而不是让提交严格串行。三个具体手法：</p>\n<p><strong>手法一：合并多条写入到一个事务。</strong> 一批 100 条 <code>INSERT</code> 放在一个事务里，只有一次提交、一组 fsync，而不是 100 次。这是声明式的收益，值得优先做。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"START TRANSACTION;&#10;INSERT INTO t VALUES (1,...), (2,...), (3,...);  -- 一条语句多值&#10;INSERT INTO t VALUES (4,...), (5,...);&#10;COMMIT;&#10;-- 2 条语句 1 次提交 vs 5 条语句 5 次提交\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">START TRANSACTION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,...), (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,...), (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,...);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 一条语句多值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,...), (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,...);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 2 条语句 1 次提交 vs 5 条语句 5 次提交</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>手法二：控制批次大小。</strong> 批次太小组提交合并率低，批次太大则单事务持锁时间过长（放大锁等待与复制延迟）。一个实用的平衡点在<strong>每批 500–2000 行或 1–5 秒的事务时长上限</strong>。对从库延迟敏感的场景，还应受 <code>binlog_group_commit_sync_delay</code> 与 <code>binlog_group_commit_sync_no_delay_count</code> 的配合——前者主动延迟一点以攒更多事务，后者设置攒够多少就立刻提交：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 主动延迟 100 微秒以攒批, 攒够 10 个就立即提交(不等满延迟)&#10;SET GLOBAL binlog_group_commit_sync_delay = 100;&#10;SET GLOBAL binlog_group_commit_sync_no_delay_count = 10;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 主动延迟 100 微秒以攒批, 攒够 10 个就立即提交(不等满延迟)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GLOBAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> binlog_group_commit_sync_delay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GLOBAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> binlog_group_commit_sync_no_delay_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>手法三：把提交从请求路径上移走。</strong> 如果业务允许微小的持久化延迟，可以先用内存队列承接再异步批量落库。这属于架构层面的取舍，会牺牲一部分持久性保证。</p>\n<p>需要强调的是，<strong>批量提交的反面是事务时长</strong>。一个 5 秒的事务会持有 5 秒的锁、阻挡 5 秒的 undo 回收、并可能造成 5 秒的复制延迟。所以批次大小的上限不应该由&quot;能跑多快&quot;决定，而应该由&quot;最长的锁等待能接受多少&quot;反推。这直接连接到 <a href=\"long-transactions-undo\">长事务、purge 线程与 undo 膨胀</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"热点行检测与容量估算\">热点行检测与容量估算</h2><p>在设计阶段就能预估热点，比上线后救火便宜得多。三个检测入口：</p>\n<p><strong>入口一：看锁等待。</strong> 在生产观察这个指标的增长速率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SHOW GLOBAL STATUS LIKE &#39;Innodb_row_lock_waits&#39;;&#10;SHOW GLOBAL STATUS LIKE &#39;Innodb_row_lock_time_avg&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GLOBAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> STATUS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Innodb_row_lock_waits'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GLOBAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> STATUS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Innodb_row_lock_time_avg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>入口二：找被更新最频繁的行。</strong> 如果表上有 <code>updated_at</code> 或自增的版本列，可以直接聚合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT id, COUNT(*) FROM t GROUP BY id ORDER BY 2 DESC LIMIT 20;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>但更直接的办法是看 <code>performance_schema</code> 的语句统计，找出同一条 <code>UPDATE</code> 语句的高频执行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT DIGEST_TEXT, COUNT_STAR, SUM_ROWS_AFFECTED,&#10;       SUM_TIMER_WAIT / COUNT_STAR / 1000000 AS avg_us&#10;FROM performance_schema.events_statements_summary_by_digest&#10;WHERE DIGEST_TEXT LIKE &#39;UPDATE%&#39;&#10;ORDER BY COUNT_STAR DESC LIMIT 20;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DIGEST_TEXT, COUNT_STAR, SUM_ROWS_AFFECTED,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       SUM_TIMER_WAIT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COUNT_STAR </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_us</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> performance_schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">events_statements_summary_by_digest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DIGEST_TEXT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UPDATE%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COUNT_STAR </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>入口三：容量估算公式。</strong> 一个热点行的理论吞吐上限可以从锁持有时间反推：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">QPS_{hot} \\approx \\frac{1}{t_{hold}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">QP</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1574em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{hold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单个事务持有该行 X 锁的时间，包括&quot;加锁 → 修改 → 提交（含 fsync）&quot;。如果 fsync 是 50 微秒且该事务只有这一处修改，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{hold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 约 60–100 微秒，理论 QPS 上限约 10000–16000；如果事务里还有其他写入或应用层在持锁期间做了网络调用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{hold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可能膨胀到毫秒级，上限降到 1000 以下。</p>\n<p>这个公式给出了最直接的诊断方式：<strong>如果实测的热点 QPS 远低于理论值，说明持锁时间被拉长了，去检查事务里有没有多余的语句或应用侧调用</strong>。最常见的错误是在事务中间做 RPC 调用或写日志到外部系统——这些操作会让锁持有时间从微秒级跳到毫秒级，吞吐下降一到两个数量级。</p>\n<p>还有一个常被忽略的热点来源是<strong>二级索引的唯一键冲突</strong>。如果一张表有一个高基数的唯一索引（比如 <code>open_id</code>），而业务上大量 <code>INSERT</code> 到相近的键区间，那么即使主键是自增的，唯一性检查也会在同一批索引页上产生 latch 争用。这类问题的表现是 CPU 高但锁等待不高，处理方法是检查 <code>performance_schema</code> 的 latch 统计，或者从索引设计上让写入分散。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>热点行的吞吐崩塌不是因为锁慢，而是因为等待者持有连接、undo 与内存却什么都不做；吞吐等于单行更新的极限，与并发数无关。</li>\n<li>行间拆分把一行变 N 行，收益线性（16 分片约降 16 倍冲突），代价是读取需要 <code>SUM</code>；分片数 8–32 已足够，选择分片应让&quot;同一时刻的热点请求&quot;落到不同分片。</li>\n<li>&quot;先查再写&quot;必须改写成单语句条件更新（<code>WHERE balance &gt;= amount</code>）或状态条件更新（<code>WHERE status = &#39;PENDING&#39;</code>），靠当前读的锁保证原子性，并通过 <code>affected_rows</code> 判断结果。</li>\n<li>状态条件更新天然幂等：重复调用返回 0 行，避免重复支付一类问题。</li>\n<li>突破 fsync 上限靠组提交：合并多条写入到一个事务、控制批次大小（500–2000 行或 1–5 秒）、必要时用 <code>binlog_group_commit_sync_delay</code> 主动攒批。</li>\n<li>热点 QPS 的理论上限是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/t_{hold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；实测远低于理论值时，检查事务中是否有应用侧 RPC 或外部 I/O 拉长了持锁时间。</li>\n<li>批次大小的上限由&quot;可接受的最长锁等待&quot;反推，而不是由写入速度决定。</li>\n<li>热点检测三个入口：<code>Innodb_row_lock_waits</code> 的增速、<code>events_statements_summary_by_digest</code> 的高频 <code>UPDATE</code>、以及 <code>GROUP BY</code> 找更新最频繁的行。</li>\n<li>事务时长是所有并发设计的最终约束，<code>History list length</code> 的监控与治理见 <a href=\"long-transactions-undo\">长事务、purge 线程与 undo 膨胀</a>；锁的兼容矩阵与死锁四模式见 <a href=\"../query-tuning/lock-wait-deadlock\">行锁、间隙锁与死锁排查</a>；建表的物理结构取舍见 <a href=\"../innodb-internals/btree-index-physical\">聚簇索引、二级索引与回表的物理细节</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"热点更新与事务设计模式","id":"热点更新与事务设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"行间拆分：把热点打散","id":"行间拆分-把热点打散"},{"level":2,"text":"原子递增与单语句条件更新","id":"原子递增与单语句条件更新"},{"level":2,"text":"批量提交：降低 fsync 次数而非降低事务数","id":"批量提交-降低-fsync-次数而非降低事务数"},{"level":2,"text":"热点行检测与容量估算","id":"热点行检测与容量估算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"隔离级别、MVCC 与 ReadView","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/mysql-performance-operations/transactions-locking/isolation-mvcc"},"next":{"title":"长事务、purge 线程与 undo 膨胀","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/mysql-performance-operations/transactions-locking/long-transactions-undo"}}